<title>USA: Triangle says board oks stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Triangle says board oks stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triangle Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 170,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the authorization amount represents about 1.6 percent of its issued and outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said shares purchased under the authorization would be used for reissuance in connection with its stock option and purchase plans, directors' compensation plans and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
